hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1464","Abu Tha’labah Al-Khushani (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat karte hain keh maine arz ki: \Ya Rasoolullah! Hum aise log hain keh hum shikar karte hain.\"" Aap (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \""Jab tum apna kutta bhejo aur us par Allah ka naam lo...\"""""""
"1465","Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke: \Humein Zoroastrian ke kutte ke pakde hue shikaar khelne se mana kiya gaya hai.\"""""""
"1466","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nmyn nay rswl allh ﷺ say baz kay pkray hwyay shkar kay baray myn pwchha۔ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw kchh wh tmharay lyay pkray\"""""""
"1467","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne farmaya: Maine kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Main shikar ko tir maarta hoon aur phir agle din apna us mein tir paata hoon.\"" Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Agar tum jaano ke tumhara tir ne us shikar ko maar daala hai...\"""""""
"1468","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (رضي الله عنه) ne rivayat kiya ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se shikar ke baare mein poocha."
"1469","Hazrat 'Adi bin Hatim (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \nMainne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se sawal kiya ke tarbiyat yafta kutte ke pakde hue shikar ke baare mein kya hukm hai? Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jab apna tarbiyat yafta kutta bhejte waqt tum Allah ka naam le lo"","" aur phir woh tumhare liye pakde hue shikar halal hai.\"""""""
"1470","Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke unki qaum ke ek aadmi ne ek ya do khargosh pakade aur unhein Marwah (pathar) se zabah kar liya. Phir unhein latka raha tha yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se unka ho gaya."
"1471","Abu Darda' (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Mujath-thamah (aik tarah ka janwar jo kisi cheez se bandha ho) ka khana mana farmaya."
"1472","Hazrat Umm Habibah (رضي الله عنها) se riwayat hai ke unke walid (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \n\Khaibar ke din...\"""""
"1473","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne kisi zinda cheez ko nishana banane se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"1474","Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Janwar ke pet mein paida hone wale bachche ka zibah"","" uske maa ke zibah karne mein shamil hai.\"""""""
"1475","Riwayat: Huzoor Muhammad ibn al-Yahya al-Naysaburi ne humse riwayat ki: Huzoor Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne riwayat ki, unho ne Isra'il se riwayat ki, unho ne Simak ibn Harb se riwayat ki, unho ne 'Alqamah ibn Wa'il al-Kindi se riwayat ki, unho ne apne Waalid (Wa'il) se riwayat ki ke ek aurat Rasoolullah ﷺ ke zamane mein namaz ke liye nikli. Ek mard ne usse mila, us par qabza kar liya aur apni khushi us se poori kar li. Aurat cheekh uthi aur bhaag gayi. Phir ek aur mard uske paas se guzra, aur us aurat ne kaha: \Us mard ne mujhe aisa-isa kiya.\"""" Phir woh Muhajireen ki ek jamaat ke paas se guzri aur usne kaha: \""""Us mard ne mujhe aisa-isa kiya.\"""" Woh log gaye aur us mard ko pakad liya jise woh shakhs samajh rahi thi ke usne us par zulm kiya hai"""","""" aur use apne saamne laaye. Us aurat ne kaha: \""""Haan"""","""" yahi woh hai.\"""" Phir use Rasoolullah ﷺ ke saamne laaye. Jab Aap ﷺ ne hukm diya ke use sangsar kiya jaye"""","""" to asal mard khada ho gaya aur bola: \""""Ya Rasoolullah"""","""" main hi hoon jisne us par zulm kiya.\"""" Aap ﷺ ne us aurat se farmaya: \""""Jao"""","""" Allah Ta'ala ne tumhe maaf kar diya.\"""" Aap ﷺ ne us mard se bhi jo ghalat se pakda gaya tha"""","""" achhi baat ki"""","""" aur Aap ﷺ ne us mard se jisne yeh kaam kiya tha"""","""" farmaya: \""""Use sangsar karo.\"""" Aap ﷺ ne yeh bhi farmaya: \""""Usne aisi tauba ki hai ke agar Madinah ke log bhi aisi tauba karein to un se bhi qubool ki jaye.\""""\n\n\n\nAbu 'Isa (Imam Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh hasan"""","""" gharib aur sahih hadith hai. 'Alqamah ibn Wa'il ibn Hujr ne apne waalid se suna hai aur woh 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn Wa'il se bade hain. 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn Wa'il ne apne waalid se nahi suna."""""""""
"1476","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: nby krym (ﷺ) nay hr aysay drnday ky khwrak ky mmanat frmayy js myn nwkyl dant (kay hywanat kay dndan) hwn۔"
"1477","Abu Al-Ushara (rz all anh) nay apnay wald say rwayt ky kh anhwn nay kha: myn nay arz ky: ya rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm)! kya grdn awr hlq kay alawh awr kwyy zbh ky jgh nhyn hay؟ aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \agr tm as ky ran myn chhry dalw tw tmharay lyay kafy hay۔\"""""""
"1478","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shaks ne ek hi ghut mein chhipkali maar di...\"""""""
"1479","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Saanp maaro aur Dhut-Tufyatain aur Al-Abtar ko maaro.\"""""""
"1480","Abu Laila (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tumhare gharon mein saanp dikhe to us se kaho: Hum tumse Nuh (علیہ السلام) ke ahad ki buniyad par tumhain nikalne ka hukm dete hain.\"""""""
"1481","Abu Kurayb aur Abu al-Sa’ib Salm ibn Junadah ne humein riwayat ki: Abu Usamah ne humein Burayd ibn ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Burdah se riwayat ki, unke dada Abu Burdah se, Abu Musa (رضي الله عنہ) se, Nabi ﷺ se, ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jo hamare khilaf hathiyar uthaye"","" woh ham mein se nahin hai.\"" (Al-Tirmidhi ne farmaya:) Is mawdo‘ par Ibn ‘Umar"","" Ibn al-Zubayr"","" Abu Hurayrah aur Salamah ibn al-Akwa‘ (رضي الله عنہم) ki bhi riwayatein hain. Abu Musa (رضي الله"""""
"1482","trjmh\n\nahmd bn mnya nhm say rwayt krtay hyn: abw maawyh nay hm say rwayt ky، asmaayl bn mslm say، hsn say، jndb say، khtay hyn: rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jadwgr ky sza tlwar ky ayk mar hay۔\"" abw aysyٰ nay kha: yh hdys mrfwaً (nby ﷺ say mnswb) srf asy snd say marwf nhyn hay۔ asmaayl bn mslm mky hdys myn zayf smjhay jatay hyn، jbkh asmaayl bn mslm abdy bsry kw wkya qwy smjhtay hyn۔ yh rwayt hsn say bhy mnqwl hay، lykn jndb say shyh nskhh mwqwf (shaby tk mwqwf) hay\n\nyh hdys shabh kram awr dygr alma myn say kchh mahryn kay aml ka mbny hay، awr yh amam malk bn ans kay nzryh kay mtabq h۔ amam shafay nay frmaya: \""jadwgr srf as swrt myn qtl kya jata hay jb as ka jadw kfr ky hd tk phnchay۔ agr as ka aml kfr say km hw، tw hm szaِ qtl ky tjwyz nhyn krtay۔\"""""""
"1483","Muhammad ibn ‘Amr al-Sawwaq ne humein riwayat ki: ‘Abd al-‘Aziz ibn Muhammad ne riwayat ki, Salih ibn Muhammad ibn Zaidah se, Salim ibn ‘Abdullah ibn ‘Umar se, ‘Abdullah ibn ‘Umar se, aur ‘Umar (رضي الله عنه) se, Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: “Jise tum Allah ki raah mein ghulul (khaynat) karte pao, uski cheezein jala do.” Salih ne kaha: Main Maslamah ke paas gaya, aur Salim ibn ‘Abdullah bhi wahaan tha. Ek aadmi ghulul karne par pakar gaya, to Salim ne yeh hadith bayan ki, aur Maslamah ne us aadmi ki cheezein jalaane ka hukm diya. Uski cheezon mein ek mushaf (Qur’an ka nuskha) bhi mila. Salim ne kaha: “Isko bech do aur uski qeemat sadaqah mein de do.” \nAbu ‘Isa ne kaha: Yeh hadith gharib hai; hum isay sirf is silsile se jaante hain. Yeh baaz ulama ka amal hai, aur yahi al-Awza‘i, Ahmad, aur Ishaq ka qaul hai. Main ne Muhammad (yaani al-Bukhari) se is hadith ke baare mein poocha, unhone kaha: “Yeh sirf Salih ibn Muhammad ibn Zaidah, jise Abu Waqid al-Laythi bhi jaana jaata hai, ne riwayat kiya hai, aur woh hadith mein munkar (mardood) maana jaata hai.” Muhammad ne aur kaha: “Rasool Allah ﷺ ki doosri riwayaat mein ghulul ke baare mein unhone ghulul karne waale ki cheezein jalaane ka hukm nahi diya.” Abu ‘Isa ne kaha: Yeh ek gharib hadith hai."
"1484","Muhammad ibn Rafi‘ ne hamain hawaale kiya: Ibn Abi Fudayk ne hamain hawaale kiya, Ibrahim ibn Isma‘il ibn Abi Habibah se, Dawud ibn al-Husayn se, ‘Ikrimah se, Ibn ‘Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se, aur Nabi Kareem ﷺ se riwayat hai ke Aap ﷺ ne farmaya: \n\n“Agar kisi shakhs doosre se kahe: ‘Ai Yahudi!’ to us par bees (20) lagao; aur agar kahe: ‘Ai mukhannath (namard)!’ to us par bees (20) lagao; aur jo shakhs kisi mahram rishtedaar se zina karey, use qatal karo.” \n\nAbu ‘Isa (Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Yeh hadith sirf is silsile se ma’loom hai. Ibrahim ibn Isma‘il hadith mein za’eef (kamzor) hain. Yeh hamare sahaba (Ahle Ilm) ki amal ki bunyaad hai, unhone kaha: “Jo shakhs jaan-boojh kar kisi mahram rishtedaar se zina karey, woh qatal ke mustahiq hai.” \n\nImam Ahmad ne farmaya: “Jo apni walida (maa) se nikah karey, woh maar diya jaye.” \nIshaq ibn Rahawayh ne farmaya: “Jo shakhs kisi mahram rishtedaar se zina karey, woh qatal ho.” \n\nIs hadith ki doosri turuq (asanid) se bhi riwayat hai, jin mein al-Bara’ ibn ‘Azib (رضي الله عنہ) aur Qurrah ibn Iyas al-Muzani (رضي الله"
"1485","Qutaybah ne hamain sunaya: al-Layth ne hamain sunaya, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashaj se, Sulayman ibn Yasar se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Abu Burdah ibn Niyar se, unhone farmaya: Rasool Allah ﷺ ne irshad farmaya: “Kisi ko das se zyada nahi maarna chahye illa yeh ke woh Allah ke hudud mein se ek hadd ho.” \nAbu Isa ne farmaya: Yeh hasan gharib hadith hai; hum isay sirf Bukayr ibn al-Ashaj ki riwayat se jaante hain. Ulama ne ta'zir (ta'deeb saza) ke mutalliq ikhtilaf kiya hai, aur is masla par sab se achi riwayat yeh hadith hai. \nYeh hadith Ibn Lahi'ah ne bhi Bukayr se rawai ki, lekin unhone ghalti ki, aur kaha: “Abd al-Rahman ibn Jabir ibn Abdullah se, uske baap se, Nabi ﷺ se”—aur yeh ghalat hai. Sahih riwayat Layth ibn Sa'd ki hadith hai: yeh Abd al-Rahman ibn Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Abu Burdah ibn Niyar se, Nabi ﷺ se."
"1486","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam chothai Dinar padhi. aur is sey ziyada ki chori par haath kaat'tey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees dusri sanadon sey Umra key wastey sey Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey marfooan aai hai, jabke baaz logon ney isey Umra key wastey sey Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey moqufan riwayat kiya hai."
"1487","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik dhaal ki chori par haath kaataa jiski qeemat teen dirham padhi. thi. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Saad , Abdullah bin Amr , ibne-Abbas , Abu-Hurera aur Aiman (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, un mein abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi shamil hain, unhoney paanch dirham ki chori par haath kaataa. 4- Usman aur Ali Raziallahu anhuma sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke un logon ney chothai Dinar ki chori par haath kaataa. 5- Abu-Hurera aur abu Saeed Khudri Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain ke paanch dirham ki chori par haath kaataa jaeyga. 6- baaz faqeeho aur Tabe-een ka isi par amal hai, Malik bin Anas , Shafai , Ahmed , Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai, ye log kehtey hain : chothai Dinar aur is sey ziyada ki chori par haath kaataa jaeyga. 7- aur ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke eik Dinar ya das dirham ki chori par hi haath kaataa jaeyga, lekin ye mursal (yani munqata') hadees hai isey Qasim bin Abdur-Rehman ney ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kiya hai, halanke Qasim ney ibne-Masood sey nahin suna hai, baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, chunanche Sufiyan Sory aur ehle-koofa ka yehi qol hai, ye log kehtey hain : das dirham sey kam ki chori par haath na kaataa jaey. 8- Ali (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke das dirham sey kam ki chori par haath nahin kaataa jaeyga, lekin iski sanad muttasil nahin hai."
"1488","Mainey Fazala bin Ubaid sey puchha : kya chor ka haath kaatney key baad uski gardan mein latkana sunnat hai? unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik chor laya gaya uska haath kaataa gaya, phir aap ney hukm diya haath uski gardan mein latka diya gaya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- hum isey sirf umr bin Ali Muqaddami hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain, unhoney isey Hujjaaj bin Irtaat sey riwayat kiya hai."
"1489","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' khayanat karney waley,daaku aur uchakke  ki saza haath kaatna nahin hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Mughira bin Muslim ney ibne-Jurej ki hadees ki tarah isey abu-Zubair sey , abu-Zubair ney Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey aur Jabir ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kiya hai. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai."
"1490","Mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''phal aur khajoor key gaabhey ki chori mein haath nahin kaataa jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- isi tarah baaz aur logon ney bhi Les bin Saad ki riwayat ki tarah ba-tareeq : (يحيى بن سعيد an محمد بن يحيى بن حبان an عمه واسع بن حبان an رافع بن خديج an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai. 2- Malik bin Anas aur kaee logon ney is hadees ko ba-tareeq : (يحيى بن سعيد an محمد بن يحيى بن حبان an رافع بن خديج an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"1491","Mainey Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna : ''jang key doran (chori karney waley ka ( haath nahin kaataa jaeyga.''Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- ibne-Lahiaa key ilawa kuchh doosrey logon ney bhi isi sanad sey isi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, unhi mein Auzaai bhi hain, ye log kehtey hain : dushman ki mojudgi mein jihad key doran (chori karney par) had qaaim nahin ki jaeygi, kyonkey jis par had qaaim ki jaeygi andesha hai ke wo dushman sey mil jaey, albatta Imam jab Darul-harab sey nikal kar Darul-Islam wapis aa jaey to chori karney waley par had qaaim karey."
"1492","Noman bin Bashir Raziallahu anhuma key paas eik aisey shakhs ka muqadma pesh huwa jisney apni biwi ki laundi key sath zina kiya tha, unhoney kaha : main is mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key faisle key mutabiq faisla karunga : agar uski biwi ney isey laundi key sath jima (sambhog) ki ijazat di hai to (bator had) isey sau kodey maaroonga aur agar usney ijazat nahin di hai to (bator had) isey rajm (sangsaar) karunga."
